{"fact": "1.8", "status": "stated", "evidence": [{"item": 5, "quote": "The story is regarded as a metaphor for British imperialism , and for Orwell 's view that"}, {"item": 5, "quote": "when the white man turns tyrant it is his own freedom that he destroys"}]}
